Everybody forgot about Nikki Haley.

00:00:14.589 --> 00:00:19.170
Nikki Haley, the former governor of South
Carolina, is also running for the Republican

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.170
nomination.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:22.520
She is getting absolutely no attention.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.240
She's desperate for relevance.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.150
