00:00:30.259 --> 00:00:31.790
This seems to be playing well among some now.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:33.300
She's not wrong.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:38.300
The biggest applause lines for the last couple
of years at right wing events, including CPAC

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:44.739
and others, have been when speakers make fun
of or go after LGBT people, it's a resurgence

00:00:44.739 --> 00:00:46.579
of that in the Republican Party.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:50.730
So here is Nikki Haley figuring out, I guess,
how to get some attention.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:54.520
Maybe people will choose her because she's
going to come out against trans people in

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.070
