00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:10.160
Where is everyone?

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:11.160
Right.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:12.800
My daughter ran track in high school.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:13.800
Did she?

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:17.040
I wouldn't even know how to have that conversation
with her.

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:22.790
How do we get our girls comfortable with biological
