00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:24.950
It's not okay.

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:26.440
Everybody know about Dylan Mulvaney.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:28.810
Bud Light, right?

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:29.810
Right.

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:30.810
Make no mistake.

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:31.810
Right.

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:34.049
That is a guy dressed up like a girl.

00:01:34.049 --> 00:01:35.049
Mm hmm.

00:01:35.049 --> 00:01:36.410
Making fun of women.

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:39.040
Women don't act like that.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:44.700
Get everybody wondering why a third of our
