00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:45.710
last year.

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:47.880
What are we doing to them?

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:53.219
We're supposed to be growing strong girls,
confident girls, not ones being made fun of.

00:01:53.219 --> 00:01:54.219
Speaker 1: Right.

00:01:54.219 --> 00:02:01.360
So one of the reasons that's actually evidence
base for the increase in suicidal ideation

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:06.539
among particularly teen girls, but teens in
general is unrestricted.

00:02:06.539 --> 00:02:11.239
Access to social media seems to be extremely
damaging in many different ways.

00:02:11.239 --> 00:02:15.470
Cal Newport has a recent podcast episode on
this issue that I highly recommend people

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:16.610
listen to.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:23.440
But the idea among the anti-trans activists
that quote, keeping men out of women's sports,

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:24.440
that's how they call it.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:26.680
We've got to keep men out of women's sports.

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:30.350
They pretend that it's a feminist issue, a
women's issue.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:37.290
The claim that banning trans women from sports
is a feminist issue number one ignores the

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:40.330
history and diversity of actual feminism.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.330
Feminism.

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:42.380
Feminism isn't this monolithic movement.

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:49.200
It's a compilation or combination of different
perspectives and goals that aim to achieve

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:52.260
what different people see as gender equality
and justice.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:57.830
And there are many feminists who support trans
rights and inclusion, and they see trans women

00:02:57.830 --> 00:03:02.569
as allies in a struggle against whatever it
is that they believe is the most important

00:03:02.569 --> 00:03:03.890
thing to struggle against.

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:11.080
And so part of the feminist movement argues
that when you exclude trans women from women's

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:15.650
spaces and activities, you're actually reinforcing
the very harmful stereotypes that feminism

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:17.220
has sought to undo.

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:23.280
But it's okay to acknowledge that the so-called
look, let's not let's call it trans women

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:29.810
and women's sports, too, to try to put a less
offensive way to describe it.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:36.880
That is a difficult issue for some sports
