00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.250
So we're understanding the scope, right?

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.209
This is not the biggest issue.

00:04:11.209 --> 00:04:14.720
There are different opinions about how it
should be handled.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:15.720
Some say so.

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:23.710
You know, 31 states have gone the way of banning
biological male individuals from women's sports

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:25.210
in some capacity.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.520
That's one approach some are taking.

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:29.500
It's been done in 31 states as of about a
year and a half ago.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.050
The number may be slightly different.

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:32.050
Now.

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:33.050
That's one view.

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:39.180
Another approach is you let transwomen biological
males.

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:40.990
